{"sections":[{"slug":"权模","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"权模"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">权模</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“权模”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">固定</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Cartan子代数","text":"Cartan <span lang=\"zh\">子代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathfrak h\\subset \\mathfrak g$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的表示</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $\\lambda\\in \\mathfrak h^*$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义权空间</span> (weight space, <span lang=\"zh\">参见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/权","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">权</span>"}},{"Plain":")\n$$\r\nM_\\lambda = \\{m\\in M: hm=\\lambda(h)m\\forall h\\in\\mathfrak h\\}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">等于所有</span> $M_\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">的直和</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则称其为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">权模</span></strong> (weight module).</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">有限维</span> $U\\mathfrak g$-<span lang=\"zh\">模都是权模</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">伴随表示是权模</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">权模对张量积封闭</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $v\\in M_\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">有</span> $Z\\mathfrak g v\\in M_\\lambda$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}